Folder Notes NG is a modified distribution of Lost Paul's Folder Notes and
includes Folder Overview by Lost Paul. NG added sync-safe creation in June
2026 and changed template writes and rename handling in November 2026.
This NG distribution is maintained independently of the upstream projects.

